&lt;li data-section-id="g8ynf8" data-start="2762" data-end="2789"&gt;Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="6fhtmz" data-start="2790" data-end="2838"&gt;Phantom equity – share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="42cmmo" data-start="2839" data-end="2884"&gt;True flexibility in how and where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="1douwzc" data-start="2885" data-end="2928"&gt;Office spaces designed for collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="fh5wv7" data-start="2929" data-end="2964"&gt;Free food and an on-site barista&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id="vtixha" data-start="2965" data-end="2983"&gt;Health cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
